.TH "TSUX" "1" "June 1, 2026" ""
.SH TSUX
tsux \- a smallish alternative for sudo
.SH SYNOPSIS
tsux   [args]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tsux is a small alsternative to sudo that passes most environment
variables trough.
It also passes the commands to the specified users default shell.
.PP
Example: tsux 0 whoami
.IP
.EX
tsux 0 mkdir /test
.EE
